<section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy notice</h1></section>
<section class="prose">
<p>When you submit a journey request, Satya Journeys collects the details you enter, which may include your name, email address, optional phone number, destination, travel dates, number of travellers, budget, preferred transport and trip preferences. We use this information to review and respond to your travel enquiry.</p>
<p>Enquiry details are stored in a private Google Sheet and an email notification is sent to the Satya Journeys contact address. Access should be limited to people handling the enquiry. Google processes the information as part of providing its Sheets and Apps Script services.</p>
<p>Please do not include payment-card details, identity documents or other sensitive information in the enquiry form. You may contact Satya Journeys to ask about your information or request its deletion. Before launch, add a monitored contact method for privacy requests and decide how long enquiry records will be retained.</p>
<p>Travel requests are not automatically confirmed bookings. Sending the form does not create a booking or guarantee availability.</p>
</section>
